    "udt_struct_v0": {
      "doc": "One independent source-to-bid-asset route.\\n\\nA liquidation may contain several routes because one Blend auction can have\\nseveral bid assets. The contract already holds the route funds and keeps\\nthe output, so a route names only the input, the expected output, the\\nminimum output and the operations.",
